              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gaafa bokaya ganna, ka hayyooti duula d'at'u, Yoabuni askarti isaatini duule lafa Amoni had'e; ammo hayyuuni Yerusalemumati hafe. Worri dira Raba marse had'e balleese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi worra Amoni, ka Milkomu jed'ani, sure worqi, ta ulfinni isii kilo sodomi afuri, qaba. Sure suni keesa d'akha ch'ululuqati jira; Daudini d'akha suni fuud'e, sure isaati keeyate. Ammalle inni waan hedu dira suni keesaa boojie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni worra dira suni ch'ufa boojie, sibiila woini ch'iranifi jembeefi d'agara iti kenne irreeni hojachiise. Inni worra Amoni ka dira d'ibi keesa jirule akasuma tolche. Duuba isaafi askartini isaa ch'ufti kaani Yerusalemuti dachaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worra Dauditifi worra d'ed'eera fufurda Filistii woli had'e",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba eegele worri Israelitiifi ka Filisti Gezeriti woli had'e, gaafasi gaafa Shebekaini, ka lafa Hushati bahe, namicha d'eera furda Shafu jed'ani ijeese, akasiini worra Filisti dabsatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
